source	Plato, Meno 80d-e, tr. B. Jowett
text	Project Gutenberg ebook 1643, https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/1643
class	equivocation
at	S2	You argue that a man cannot enquire
fault	"know" covers both knowing fully and knowing enough to recognise: the dilemma holds only if it means the same in both horns
reference	G. Fine, The Possibility of Inquiry (2014), ch. 1
known	canon
